{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c3b36c561a42b3b5","name":"Tehk'la Blade","source":{"id":"source:reference-c3b36c561a42b3b5","title":"Tehk'la Blade","revision":20323,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:38:13Z","sha256":"83bb610622809c4cae10eb09ba9e95f4efad8f0ce94354f47c88cdce4f5d6f20","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20323","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Tehk%27la%20Blade&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c3b36c561a42b3b5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Tehk'la Blade is a handheld weapon in common use throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nagai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nagai","referenceId":"reference:d88fbbdb7db0613d"}," society. Similar in design to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibrodaggers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibrodaggers"},", Tehk'la Blades are fashioned individually for, and often by, the owner of the weapon. The leading edge of a Tehk'la Blade is serrated, and vibration inducers cause it to oscillate at several thousand cycles per minute, enhancing its cutting power. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nagai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nagai","referenceId":"reference:d88fbbdb7db0613d"}," fighting style that employs Tehk'la Blades relies on wounding an enemy, whittling him down until their lack of effectiveness permits a killing blow. The blades are designed to tear and rend as they are withdrawn from stab wounds, making them particularly fearsome in the hands of a trained combatant.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the attack roll made by the wielder of a Tehk'la Blade equals or exceeds both the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target takes an additional 1d6 points of damage from bleeding at the start of its next turn. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nagai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nagai","referenceId":"reference:d88fbbdb7db0613d"}," treat Tehk'la Blades as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"}," instead of as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:e0213365f7fdde76"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Tehk'la Blade requires an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:e0213365f7fdde76"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 8,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Slashing and Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
